WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.014 --> 00:00:02.383
[Music: ‘He’s a Black Flame Dragon’ theme song]

2
00:00:53.367 --> 00:00:55.970
{\an8}Ah, it was going really well.
I'm sick of reporters

3
00:00:56.037 --> 00:00:57.333
{\an8}I'm glad I didn't get into an accident

4
00:00:57.400 --> 00:00:59.974
{\an8}The team leader seemed very surprised.

5
00:01:00.041 --> 00:01:01.558
{\an8}(Seokhee) If it were me, I would have fainted.

6
00:01:01.625 --> 00:01:03.244
{\an8}It's not easy to date an heir.

7
00:01:03.311 --> 00:01:05.295
{\an8}(Nana) Ah, but the store employees

8
00:01:05.362 --> 00:01:08.749
{\an8}Thanks to the team leader and general manager
You know I see it a lot.

9
00:01:08.816 --> 00:01:10.434
{\an8}Oh, I really don't know anything
[Calm music]

10
00:01:10.501 --> 00:01:13.053
{\an8}(Junsu) Oh, so the comments on the article too
That's all there is to it

11
00:01:13.120 --> 00:01:14.171
{\an8}Oh, if it's going to be like this, it's better

12
00:01:14.238 --> 00:01:16.306
{\an8}Team leader
Wouldn’t it be better to go to the Big Forest?

13
00:01:16.373 --> 00:01:18.476
{\an8}Scouting conditions
I think it's much better

14
00:01:27.016 --> 00:01:29.498
{\an8}(Nana) With the real team leader
I don't want to break up

15
00:01:29.987 --> 00:01:32.273
{\an8}For the team leader
That would be better, really.

16
00:01:32.340 --> 00:01:35.767
{\an8}(Seokhee) Ah, but I still have a boyfriend.
How do I get to America?

17
00:01:35.834 --> 00:01:37.600
[Nana moans with a headache]
(Junsu) Let’s organize everything quickly.

18
00:01:37.667 --> 00:01:38.546
(Seokhee) Yes

19
00:01:48.990 --> 00:01:50.057
[sigh]

20
00:01:53.077 --> 00:01:56.447
(In-kyung) Regarding Team Leader Baek’s personal details,
The article was banned from publication.

21
00:01:56.947 --> 00:01:58.215
But...

22
00:01:58.282 --> 00:02:00.084
Even the posts that spread on social media

23
00:02:00.151 --> 00:02:02.352
It's hard to organize everything.

24
00:02:02.419 --> 00:02:03.487
I can't help it

25
00:02:05.022 --> 00:02:07.157
Thank you for your hard work
Please go in

26
00:02:07.224 --> 00:02:08.725
The general manager too

27
00:02:08.792 --> 00:02:10.611
Get off work quickly, it's late.

28
00:02:10.678 --> 00:02:11.538
yes

29
00:02:32.783 --> 00:02:33.784
(Main role) Mr. Sujeong

30
00:02:38.255 --> 00:02:39.607
If you want to leave, leave

31
00:02:42.259 --> 00:02:43.444
Even tomorrow

32
00:02:44.734 --> 00:02:46.734
[Calm music]

33
00:02:48.449 --> 00:02:50.651
(Edited) What does that mean all of a sudden?

34
00:02:51.168 --> 00:02:53.487
I received a job offer from Big Forest.

35
00:02:53.554 --> 00:02:54.388
Right?

36
00:02:55.934 --> 00:02:56.958
(Edited) Ah...

37
00:02:59.543 --> 00:03:01.345
(Main lead) Even though America is a problem

38
00:03:02.379 --> 00:03:04.031
I think it's a good opportunity for you, Sujeong.

39
00:03:04.648 --> 00:03:05.683
If you're here

40
00:03:06.734 --> 00:03:08.703
Because it's hard to get proper recognition, I guess

41
00:03:10.988 --> 00:03:12.440
(TBC) It’s in Yongseong, right?

42
00:03:13.140 --> 00:03:16.093
You will continue to see such damage.

43
00:03:16.160 --> 00:03:18.846
Ban Joo-yeon's
I will only remain as your girlfriend.

44
00:03:22.199 --> 00:03:23.567
(Juyeon) I am Sujeong

45
00:03:23.634 --> 00:03:25.586
I hope you can freely unfold your abilities

46
00:03:27.805 --> 00:03:28.939
So...

47
00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:32.476
Are you telling me to leave tomorrow?

48
00:03:32.543 --> 00:03:33.577
yes

49
00:03:33.644 --> 00:03:34.762
Anytime you want

50
00:03:36.255 --> 00:03:38.840
When I go, I go to Korea
I don't know when I'll be back?

51
00:03:40.150 --> 00:03:41.302
It doesn't matter

52
00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:44.805
- Then what about Juyeon?
- (Main lead) Ah

53
00:03:44.872 --> 00:03:46.173
You don't have to worry about me

54
00:03:47.501 --> 00:03:49.501
[humorous music]

55
00:03:55.858 --> 00:03:56.826
yes

56
00:03:57.577 --> 00:03:59.487
I'll think about it, positively.

57
00:03:59.987 --> 00:04:01.522
You've had a hard time so far.

58
00:04:02.106 --> 00:04:03.791
Take a few days off and think about it.

59
00:04:05.092 --> 00:04:06.160
That's good

60
00:04:07.111 --> 00:04:09.267
I still had a lot of annual leave left.

61
00:04:09.334 --> 00:04:10.331
[light laughter]

62
00:04:13.801 --> 00:04:15.147
Uh, shall we go home?

63
00:04:16.613 --> 00:04:18.272
- Are you going already?
- (Edited) Yes

64
00:04:18.922 --> 00:04:21.125
We need to think about it right now.

65
00:04:31.935 --> 00:04:33.154
(Edited) True

66
00:04:33.221 --> 00:04:34.555
Are you leaving tomorrow?

67
00:04:35.372 --> 00:04:38.075
Even though I don't know when I'll come back
Doesn't it matter?

68
00:04:38.142 --> 00:04:40.761
Ah, even if you live without seeing me
What do you mean it works?

69
00:04:40.828 --> 00:04:43.998
Yes, but even if it’s just me
I think they'll tell me to leave

70
00:04:44.065 --> 00:04:45.966
(Hajin) Something like that happened today

71
00:04:48.018 --> 00:04:50.921
so what are you going to do
Have you thought about it?

72
00:04:51.555 --> 00:04:52.623
(Edited) Thoughts?

73
00:04:53.857 --> 00:04:55.626
Thanks to you, I did a lot

74
00:04:55.693 --> 00:04:57.427
If it's right to leave

75
00:04:57.494 --> 00:04:59.430
What am I leaving for?

76
00:05:00.564 --> 00:05:02.466
If you stay, why should you stay?

77
00:05:03.334 --> 00:05:04.668
When I thought about it

78
00:05:06.003 --> 00:05:08.072
Still, it came to a conclusion sooner than expected.

79
00:05:08.972 --> 00:05:10.024
(Hajin) Really?

80
00:05:11.775 --> 00:05:12.993
(Edited) Yes

81
00:05:13.060 --> 00:05:15.060
[humorous music]

82
00:05:19.216 --> 00:05:22.119
{\an8}(main role)

83
00:05:28.075 --> 00:05:31.946
{\an8}(edited)

84
00:05:35.666 --> 00:05:36.867
{\an8}(main role)

85
00:05:36.934 --> 00:05:39.499
{\an8}(edited)

86
00:05:42.557 --> 00:05:43.992
{\an8}(main role)

87
00:05:52.666 --> 00:05:54.168
[sigh]

88
00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:06.881
[Shinwon’s light sigh]

89
00:06:09.199 --> 00:06:10.401
(Main lead) Director Kim Shin-won?

90
00:06:11.135 --> 00:06:12.469
Sighing since morning

91
00:06:12.536 --> 00:06:13.871
Last leaf, what is it?

92
00:06:14.838 --> 00:06:17.708
Walking around laughing here and there
Discipline in the company was impaired

93
00:06:18.275 --> 00:06:20.911
Now like this
Are you lowering employee morale?

94
00:06:20.978 --> 00:06:22.379
What are you talking about again?

95
00:06:22.446 --> 00:06:24.981
These days, I don't eat much and I don't smile much.

96
00:06:25.048 --> 00:06:27.067
(Juyeon) I heard you say hello and then say hello?

97
00:06:27.134 --> 00:06:29.503
I told my employees
Should I listen to your worries?

98
00:06:30.020 --> 00:06:33.123
So are you worried about me too?

99
00:06:33.190 --> 00:06:34.391
yes

100
00:06:34.458 --> 00:06:36.527
I'm worried that my brother will miss you if he continues like this.

101
00:06:39.300 --> 00:06:40.281
(Shinwon) Uh

102
00:06:41.532 --> 00:06:42.466
Did you hear what I said?

103
00:06:42.533 --> 00:06:44.735
It's amazing what people do.

104
00:06:44.802 --> 00:06:46.754
(Juyeon) I’ve seen you for such a long time.

105
00:06:46.821 --> 00:06:48.322
Now I know my brother is a coward

106
00:06:49.740 --> 00:06:51.508
Because I've never had to be afraid before

107
00:06:52.075 --> 00:06:53.360
What do you think about your sister?

108
00:06:54.767 --> 00:06:57.147
[Calm music]

109
00:06:57.214 --> 00:06:59.716
(Juyeon) When jumping into the sea
Fear and anxiety are the same

110
00:07:00.184 --> 00:07:01.385
Nevertheless, my sister

111
00:07:02.686 --> 00:07:04.004
I was looking for my brother

112
00:07:04.922 --> 00:07:05.923
With courage

113
00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:17.734
Accompanying performance

114
00:07:18.735 --> 00:07:19.987
You really have grown up

115
00:07:25.660 --> 00:07:28.062
(main role)

116
00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:30.898
Are you still sleeping?

117
00:07:32.082 --> 00:07:33.050
(Junsu) Yes, team leader

118
00:07:33.650 --> 00:07:34.935
I'll handle it like that.

119
00:07:35.002 --> 00:07:36.319
[humorous music]

120
00:07:36.386 --> 00:07:38.588
Oh yeah, don't worry about work
Please rest well.

121
00:07:38.655 --> 00:07:40.341
Yeah, uh, surprise!
[Humorous sound effects]

122
00:07:41.391 --> 00:07:42.576
The team leader I just spoke to

123
00:07:42.643 --> 00:07:44.278
Are you really team leader Baek Soo-jeong?

124
00:07:44.979 --> 00:07:45.796
Yes, of course

125
00:07:45.863 --> 00:07:48.834
Well, the team leader told us
Because there is only Team Leader Baek Soo-jeong.

126
00:07:48.901 --> 00:07:50.317
[Humorous sound effects]

127
00:07:51.319 --> 00:07:52.553
[Humorous sound effects]

128
00:07:54.104 --> 00:07:56.206
(Junsu) Oh my, you chewed it without reading it.

129
00:07:58.219 --> 00:07:59.059
[Junsu’s light smile]

130
00:07:59.126 --> 00:08:01.095
Ah, to the team leader
Did you do something wrong?

131
00:08:01.162 --> 00:08:02.279
It can't be

132
00:08:02.346 --> 00:08:03.397
I would have been rather moved.

133
00:08:03.464 --> 00:08:05.015
(Junsu) Ah, I was touched.
Why aren't you reading it?

134
00:08:05.082 --> 00:08:06.141
Document shredding!

135
00:08:07.184 --> 00:08:08.318
Do you want to do it again?

136
00:08:09.536 --> 00:08:10.537
no!

137
00:08:11.021 --> 00:08:12.756
I saw this wrong, that...

138
00:08:12.823 --> 00:08:15.359
(Junsu) This is because you were talking to me on the phone.
I guess you haven't seen it yet

139
00:08:15.959 --> 00:08:17.611
Look again, look again

140
00:08:17.678 --> 00:08:18.697
(Nana) Yes, team leader

141
00:08:19.229 --> 00:08:21.233
- Oh, yes, I saw the message you just sent.
- (Seokhee) Hello?

142
00:08:21.300 --> 00:08:22.349
(Nana) Hello

143
00:08:22.983 --> 00:08:24.151
[Humorous sound effects]

144
00:08:25.853 --> 00:08:27.531
Team leader, what are you doing on your annual leave?

145
00:08:30.224 --> 00:08:32.859
Don't worry, leave it to me.

146
00:08:33.634 --> 00:08:34.563
[Nana’s laughter]
[Weak cough]

147
00:08:35.630 --> 00:08:38.181
(Junsu) That’s Team Leader Hyeju, right?

148
00:08:38.248 --> 00:08:39.066
(Nana) Team leader Sujeong.
[Sparkling sound effect]

149
00:08:39.133 --> 00:08:41.068
(Junsu) That’s right, oh my gosh
[Sound effect of can collapsing]

150
00:08:42.470 --> 00:08:43.373
[Subin sighs]

151
00:08:44.221 --> 00:08:45.239
(Soobin) No

152
00:08:45.306 --> 00:08:48.542
I need to save my stamina to take the exam soon.
Do you really have to make me do it?

153
00:08:48.609 --> 00:08:49.459
Oh, and some

154
00:08:49.526 --> 00:08:51.845
Take care of your own luggage
Tell me to clean it up

155
00:08:51.912 --> 00:08:53.333
[Humorous sound effects]
(Edited) Now

156
00:08:53.400 --> 00:08:55.549
[Humorous sound effects]
[Soobin’s awkward laugh]

157
00:08:56.116 --> 00:08:58.085
Is there any luggage left?

158
00:08:58.152 --> 00:09:00.821
Oh, you are a burden, you are a burden

159
00:09:00.888 --> 00:09:02.305
[Subin's irritated breathing]

160
00:09:02.372 --> 00:09:04.775
(Soobin) Ah, but
Why are you suddenly taking off your luggage?

161
00:09:05.293 --> 00:09:07.529
Oh, did they fight again?

162
00:09:08.370 --> 00:09:09.678
Ah, fighting

163
00:09:09.745 --> 00:09:11.834
I'm just trying to organize it when I have time.

164
00:09:11.901 --> 00:09:14.217
[cell phone vibrating sound]
(Edited) Ah, if you leave it in the attic, it will just collect dust.

165
00:09:16.086 --> 00:09:17.554
Yes, have you arrived?

166
00:09:18.255 --> 00:09:19.457
Oh, yes, just a moment.

167
00:09:19.524 --> 00:09:20.841
Hey, bring this down

168
00:09:20.908 --> 00:09:22.467
Yes, I'm going out.

169
00:09:22.534 --> 00:09:24.761
[upbeat music]
[Call connection tone] (information voice) Because the customer is on the phone

170
00:09:24.828 --> 00:09:27.643
After the beep
Connected via Sorisam Quick Voice...

171
00:09:32.367 --> 00:09:33.253
[Juyeon’s frustrated sigh]

172
00:09:36.490 --> 00:09:38.158
(Juyeon) Did I offend you?

173
00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:41.345
That can't be possible

174
00:09:46.200 --> 00:09:47.134
[Sound of door closing]

175
00:09:49.036 --> 00:09:50.170
Director?

176
00:09:52.139 --> 00:09:53.207
[sigh]

177
00:09:54.291 --> 00:09:55.292
Manager?

178
00:09:57.628 --> 00:09:58.595
It's an emergency

179
00:10:03.350 --> 00:10:05.368
[Interesting music]
So

180
00:10:05.435 --> 00:10:07.100
The last conversation

181
00:10:07.167 --> 00:10:09.306
You told me to leave?

182
00:10:09.373 --> 00:10:11.224
Even tomorrow?

183
00:10:11.291 --> 00:10:12.142
That's right

184
00:10:12.209 --> 00:10:15.512
When will I return to Korea?
You said it doesn't matter?

185
00:10:15.579 --> 00:10:16.847
That's also correct

186
00:10:17.614 --> 00:10:19.449
Of course we won't be able to contact you.

187
00:10:19.516 --> 00:10:21.001
Because you would be angry

188
00:10:21.802 --> 00:10:22.986
Are you angry?

189
00:10:23.053 --> 00:10:25.622
No, when you decide
I was careful not to feel burdened.

190
00:10:25.689 --> 00:10:29.059
Excessive consideration can also make people feel sad.

191
00:10:29.126 --> 00:10:32.228
(In-kyung) A lover becomes so easily
They tell me to leave alone

192
00:10:32.295 --> 00:10:33.597
If you're not upset

193
00:10:33.664 --> 00:10:35.482
Isn't that strange?

194
00:10:36.751 --> 00:10:37.818
What are you talking about?

195
00:10:39.169 --> 00:10:40.320
I'm going with you too.

196
00:10:42.372 --> 00:10:44.507
(Juyeon) Of course, it would be difficult to go together right away.

197
00:10:44.574 --> 00:10:46.509
That's not where my job is.

198
00:10:46.576 --> 00:10:48.311
You also need to receive a job offer.

199
00:10:48.378 --> 00:10:49.963
Because I have to solve my problems at home too.

200
00:10:52.082 --> 00:10:53.550
like that

201
00:10:53.617 --> 00:10:54.868
Did you say it?

202
00:10:55.436 --> 00:10:56.786
[Humorous sound effects]
Are you going together?

203
00:10:56.853 --> 00:10:59.039
Now we're like one body
Such an obvious thing...

204
00:10:59.106 --> 00:11:01.190
[Exciting music]

205
00:11:01.675 --> 00:11:03.276
[surprised gasp]
[Humorous sound effects]

206
00:11:03.343 --> 00:11:04.678
[cell phone vibrating sound]

207
00:11:07.397 --> 00:11:10.350
(Subin) My sister was organizing my brother-in-law’s luggage.
Do you know?

208
00:11:11.668 --> 00:11:14.704
I guess you're very angry
I need to clear up the misunderstanding right away.

209
00:11:14.771 --> 00:11:15.789
That's enough

210
00:11:16.740 --> 00:11:19.760
I think it would be better to solve it by looking at the face.

211
00:11:22.029 --> 00:11:22.930
As expected

212
00:11:22.997 --> 00:11:24.267
[Sparkling sound effect]
age

213
00:11:24.334 --> 00:11:25.994
[bird chirping]

214
00:11:28.601 --> 00:11:29.953
[Call connection tone]

215
00:11:30.020 --> 00:11:30.987
(Main role) Mr. Sujeong

216
00:11:31.054 --> 00:11:32.422
Why can't I contact you like this?

217
00:11:32.489 --> 00:11:33.957
I'm in front of Sujeong's house right now.

218
00:11:34.491 --> 00:11:36.159
(Edited) Yes?
Still time to be at work...

219
00:11:36.226 --> 00:11:37.594
I have something urgent to tell you.

220
00:11:38.779 --> 00:11:39.913
Can you come out for a moment?

221
00:11:40.381 --> 00:11:43.183
(Edited) Oh, what should I do?
I'm not home right now

222
00:11:43.734 --> 00:11:44.768
Where is it?

223
00:11:44.835 --> 00:11:45.936
let me go there

224
00:11:46.554 --> 00:11:47.588
(Edited) Ah...

225
00:11:48.605 --> 00:11:51.559
That's Juyeon's house.
See you at home then

226
00:11:51.626 --> 00:11:52.726
[Call end sound]
[bird chirping]

227
00:11:53.667 --> 00:11:55.667
[Exciting music]

228
00:11:56.313 --> 00:11:57.731
You already unpacked all my luggage?

229
00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:04.004
(Main role) Mr. Sujeong

230
00:12:07.341 --> 00:12:08.375
Mr. Crystal

231
00:12:13.213 --> 00:12:14.414
(Edited) Ha, are you here?

232
00:12:19.501 --> 00:12:20.598
[Calm music]

233
00:12:20.665 --> 00:12:22.456
(Juyeon) I didn’t mean to send you alone.

234
00:12:22.523 --> 00:12:25.526
They told me to leave for America.
Of course I was planning to go together.

235
00:12:27.728 --> 00:12:29.229
It was like that too

236
00:12:32.516 --> 00:12:33.717
(Juyeon) Did you know?

237
00:12:34.667 --> 00:12:36.553
(Sujeong) Ah, when I first heard it,

238
00:12:37.120 --> 00:12:40.857
I wonder if it's easy to stay away from me
I was sad and disappointed

239
00:12:40.924 --> 00:12:42.876
Now that I think about it, it can't be possible.

240
00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:45.312
So I tried to talk more.

241
00:12:46.396 --> 00:12:48.249
No, but why aren't you replying?

242
00:12:48.316 --> 00:12:49.566
Are you moving all your luggage?

243
00:12:49.633 --> 00:12:53.003
I can't answer what's going on
I tried to hold an event

244
00:12:53.837 --> 00:12:54.871
Event?

245
00:12:55.906 --> 00:12:57.073
Thank you

246
00:12:57.641 --> 00:13:00.093
(Edited) This is how far I have come
There is someone who thinks of me

247
00:13:00.577 --> 00:13:04.080
Whether we want to leave together or not
It was a decision for me.

248
00:13:04.147 --> 00:13:07.193
So the general manager
Decorate your house with things you like

249
00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:09.962
Let’s cook something delicious
I was trying to wait

250
00:13:11.367 --> 00:13:12.372
[Juyeon’s surprised gasp]

251
00:13:12.856 --> 00:13:13.941
Come here for a moment

252
00:13:16.177 --> 00:13:17.344
Ta-da!

253
00:13:18.028 --> 00:13:19.346
Sujeong, this is it!
[Sparkling sound effect]

254
00:13:19.413 --> 00:13:22.167
[Soft music]
